{
  "$comment": "Maps connector tool groups and tools onto this power's skills. Read by scripts/sync-from-connector.py. A tool that belongs to a mapped group but is not listed in any section is placed in an auto-generated 'New tools (needs placement)' section of that skill, which scripts/validate.py rejects until a human moves it. A tool whose group matches no skill is reported as unassigned.",
